{"action_zh": "织体识别同时观察声部数量、密度、音区和声部交互，并限定在当前选区。", "avoid_zh": "避免用全曲单一标签覆盖局部织体变化。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "local scope", "density"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-001", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "local scope", "density"], "title_zh": "织体是局部关系"}
{"action_zh": "仅有一个独立活动旋律线时标为 monophonic，并保留同度加倍可能造成的歧义。", "avoid_zh": "避免仅按谱表数量判断单声部或复调。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "monophonic", "voice count"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-002", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "monophonic", "voice count"], "title_zh": "单声部识别"}
{"action_zh": "多个声部攻击点高度同步且节奏轮廓相近时，优先识别为 homorhythmic_chordal。", "avoid_zh": "避免因偶然同时起音就把整段误判为齐奏式和弦。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "homorhythmic_chordal", "onset alignment"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-003", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "homorhythmic_chordal", "onset alignment"], "title_zh": "同节奏和弦织体"}
{"action_zh": "有明确主线角色，且其节奏或音区与支撑层形成对比时，识别为 melody_accompaniment。", "avoid_zh": "避免默认最高音永远是旋律；优先结合 track role 与持续显著度。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "melody_accompaniment", "role"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-004", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "melody_accompaniment", "role"], "title_zh": "旋律伴奏识别"}
{"action_zh": "多条声部具有不同攻击模式与可追踪旋律连续性时，提高 contrapuntal 置信度。", "avoid_zh": "避免把分解和弦的单一功能层误判为独立复调。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "contrapuntal", "rhythmic independence"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-005", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "contrapuntal", "rhythmic independence"], "title_zh": "复调识别"}
{"action_zh": "多声部轮廓高度相似但装饰与时值不完全一致时标记异音可能性并降低确定度。", "avoid_zh": "避免在缺乏旋律对应证据时强行标记 heterophony。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "heterophony", "contour similarity"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-006", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "heterophony", "contour similarity"], "title_zh": "异音歧义"}
{"action_zh": "当多个角色持续共存但不满足齐奏或独立复调阈值时使用 layered，并列出角色证据。", "avoid_zh": "避免把 layered 当作无法分析时的无证据兜底。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "layered", "functional layers"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-007", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "layered", "functional layers"], "title_zh": "分层织体识别"}
{"action_zh": "活动声部少、攻击间隔大且留白显著时标记 sparse 特征，但保留基本纹理类别。", "avoid_zh": "避免把休止较多直接等同于单声部。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "sparse", "space"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-008", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "sparse", "space"], "title_zh": "稀疏织体"}
{"action_zh": "以精确拍位比较同时攻击比例，作为同节奏与和弦织体证据。", "avoid_zh": "避免用浮点近似误合并不同拍位。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "onset alignment", "exact time"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-009", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "onset alignment", "exact time"], "title_zh": "攻击点对齐率"}
{"action_zh": "对声部攻击集合计算成对相似度，区分共同节奏与独立节奏。", "avoid_zh": "避免只比较音符总数而忽略攻击位置。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "rhythmic similarity", "voice interaction"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-010", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "rhythmic similarity", "voice interaction"], "title_zh": "声部节奏相似度"}
{"action_zh": "符号分析应记录当前只建模攻击点；需要判断持续重叠时必须扩展时值区间分析。", "avoid_zh": "避免把攻击点分类结果描述成完整声学纹理。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "sustain", "limitation"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.9, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-011", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "sustain", "limitation"], "title_zh": "持续音局限"}
{"action_zh": "若 ScoreDocument track 已标记 lead_melody，应优先于简单最高音启发式。", "avoid_zh": "避免忽略宿主或用户已明确的声部角色。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "lead_melody", "track role"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.9, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-012", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "lead_melody", "track role"], "title_zh": "主线角色优先"}
{"action_zh": "无角色元数据时综合右手倾向、音区、事件数量与连续性选择主线。", "avoid_zh": "避免仅凭单个最高音选择旋律。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "salience", "fallback"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-013", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "salience", "fallback"], "title_zh": "主线显著度后备"}
{"action_zh": "主线与支撑层平均音区明显分离可加强旋律伴奏解释。", "avoid_zh": "避免把音区分离单独当作角色证明。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "register separation", "melody_accompaniment"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-014", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "register separation", "melody_accompaniment"], "title_zh": "音区分离"}
{"action_zh": "最低持续或规律声部承担根音与拍点时标记 functional bass 角色。", "avoid_zh": "避免把偶然最低音一律视为独立低音层。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "functional bass", "role"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-015", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "functional bass", "role"], "title_zh": "功能低音层"}
{"action_zh": "中音区较同步、轮廓独立性较低的声部可标记 harmonic filler。", "avoid_zh": "避免让填充层在音区和节奏上持续遮蔽主线。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "harmonic filler", "role"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-016", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "harmonic filler", "role"], "title_zh": "和声填充层"}
{"action_zh": "重复攻击模式稳定强调拍层时标记 explicit beat 或 ostinato 功能。", "avoid_zh": "避免仅因重复音高就假设其承担节拍功能。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "explicit beat", "ostinato"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-017", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "explicit beat", "ostinato"], "title_zh": "脉冲层"}
{"action_zh": "短暂插入、问答或异质材料应作为 novelty layer，而非持续主线。", "avoid_zh": "避免新奇层持续占据主线音区和最大密度。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "novelty layer", "call response"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-018", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "novelty layer", "call response"], "title_zh": "新奇层"}
{"action_zh": "旋律活跃时降低支撑层节奏或音区竞争，旋律停顿时再允许伴奏填充。", "avoid_zh": "避免所有层同时达到最高活动度。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "melody_accompaniment", "complementary rhythm"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-019", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "melody_accompaniment", "complementary rhythm"], "title_zh": "主线与伴奏互补"}
{"action_zh": "独立声部保持可辨识轮廓，并用交错活动与音区规划避免长期遮蔽。", "avoid_zh": "避免用简单音量或音符数量解决全部复调平衡问题。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "contrapuntal", "voice balance"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-020", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "contrapuntal", "voice balance"], "title_zh": "复调声部平衡"}
{"action_zh": "块状和弦或赞美诗式段落让声部共享句法节奏，同时保持外声部方向与和声连接。", "avoid_zh": "避免只追求垂直和弦而忽略横向声部进行。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "homorhythmic_chordal", "voice leading"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-021", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "homorhythmic_chordal", "voice leading"], "title_zh": "同节奏写作"}
{"action_zh": "若单一支撑声部按稳定顺序展开和弦音，将其识别为 arpeggiated accompaniment。", "avoid_zh": "避免把每个分解音都当作独立旋律。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "arpeggiated", "accompaniment"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-022", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "arpeggiated", "accompaniment"], "title_zh": "分解和弦辨识"}
{"action_zh": "改变织体前先减少或共享一个角色，再引入新的密度、音区或攻击关系。", "avoid_zh": "避免无过渡地同时改变所有声部角色。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "transition", "form"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-023", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "transition", "form"], "title_zh": "织体转换准备"}
{"action_zh": "最厚织体只用于少数结构峰值，并在前后保留密度对比。", "avoid_zh": "避免全段持续同样厚度导致层次失效。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "density arc", "climax"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-024", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "density arc", "climax"], "title_zh": "织体峰值保留"}
{"action_zh": "当前 Composer 只改音高时，应验证声部、攻击点、时值和事件数量的织体骨架完全不变。", "avoid_zh": "避免把音高改写伪装成已经完成的结构性织体重配。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "host scaffold", "protected scope"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.96, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-025", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "host scaffold", "protected scope"], "title_zh": "织体骨架保护"}
{"action_zh": "规划同时记录 source_texture 与 target_texture；若结构编辑不受支持，只能解释目标而不能假装实现。", "avoid_zh": "避免将 LLM 选择的目标织体误报为原谱识别结果。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "source texture", "target texture"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.94, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-026", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "source texture", "target texture"], "title_zh": "织体目标与源织体分离"}
{"action_zh": "证据接近阈值或选区音符不足时显示 mixed/unknown 与具体指标。", "avoid_zh": "避免在证据不足时给出高置信度单一标签。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "confidence", "unknown"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.9, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-027", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "confidence", "unknown"], "title_zh": "低置信度显示"}
{"action_zh": "织体分类用于选择规则和检查保护，不把某类织体当作更高级或更好听。", "avoid_zh": "避免用分类标签替代风格、功能和人工判断。", "domain": "texture", "goals": ["texture", "evaluation", "human review"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize", "orchestration_advice"], "priority": 0.95, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-TEXTURE-028", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["texture", "evaluation", "human review"], "title_zh": "织体非审美等级"}
